# What `check-voice` and `sign-copy` read in this repo.
#
# Naming this file turns the default off, so everything the default found
# has to be listed as well: the readme and the site, which are copy too.
# `src/says.rs` is the addition. The engine's `--help` text lives there and
# not in `src/lib.rs`, because the gate signs a whole file's bytes and
# `lib.rs` changes whenever the engine does.
README.md
site/content/*.md
src/says.rs
